span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11.5</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐς τὸ πρόσθε παριέναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">forward</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.89</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πάριτ' εἰς τὸ π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ach.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">43</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἰς τὸ π. προΐωμεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">437a</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">μηδεμίαν αἰσχύνην π. ποιεῖσθαι</span> allow to stand <b class=\"lex-tr\">in the way</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">732b</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> metaph., <span class=\"gk\">εἰς τὸ π. ἔτι ζητήσαντες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">258c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοὺς ὄπισθεν εἰς τὸ π. ἄξομεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1249</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> of Time, <b class=\"lex-tr\">before, formerly, erst</b>, <span class=\"gk\">οὗ καὶ π. ἀρίστη φαίνετο βουλή</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.325</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">οὔποτε π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">318</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὔπω π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.4.18</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἔτι π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">242d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σμικρῷ π.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">969b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἱ π. ἄνδρες</span> the men <b class=\"lex-tr\">of old</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.524</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τοῦ π. Κάδμου τοῦ πάλαι τ' Ἀγήνορος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OT</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">268</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὁ π. γεννηθείς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">375</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἡ π.</span> the <b class=\"lex-tr\">elder</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">58</span> </span>; of things, <span class=\"gk\">οἱ π. πόνοι</span> the <b class=\"lex-tr\">former, earlier</b> labours, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">52</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">ἁ π. ἱππεία</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">504</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">ὁ π. λόγος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\